    </div>
    <div class="bottom">
      <span>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> TrioCraft Brands Ltd. All rights reserved.</span>
      <span><a href="/privacy" style="color:inherit">Privacy</a> · <a href="/terms" style="color:inherit">Terms</a> · Nairobi, Kenya</span>
